      "say": "The budget adds up. The due dates don't."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "start": 2.77,
      "end": 8.66,
      "say": "In this made-up plan, the venue, caterer and photographer each want a deposit, then a balance."
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "start": 9.04,
      "end": 14.78,
      "say": "The deposits are spread out, but all three balances land in the same month, just before the wedding."
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "start": 15.16,
      "end": 21.04,
      "say": "So before you sign, list every payment with its due date, and start saving early for that heavy month."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "start": 21.42,
      "end": 26.01,
      "say": "Ask what's refundable if plans change, and get the whole schedule in writing."
    },
